  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "策略理論與中國崛起",
    "sub_ename": "STRATEGIC THEORY AND CHINA'S RISE",
    "describe_ch": "策略最初原為兵學領域所專研，惟近年策略思維已逐漸在學界及企業界廣泛運用，因此本課程參酌軍事及企業理論中之策略分析，使同學理解策略之緣起、意義及運用方法。課中將以二次世界大戰及雅爾達密約作實證說明，並佐以中國政經策略分析，藉此讓同學認識崛起中的中國，了解其影響力，從而建立自己的策略邏輯及世界觀!",
    "describe_eh": "Originally applied in military science, Strategic Thinking (\"ST\") has now been widely applied in business and academic community.  With the introduction of basic concepts and cases of strategic theory, this course aims to help students comprehend the general rationale and application of ST.\r\nBy discussing the cases of WWⅡ and the Yalta Conference, together with the analysis of China's economic and political strategies, it is expected that students can have basic understanding of China's rise and its influence on the world, and hence cultivate their own independent ST and world views.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "協助學生認識中國大陸的策略理論與學習國家崛起的要素及領導人的策略行銷理論在國家整體發展之應用。",
      "describe_en": "Assist students in understanding the strategic theories of China and the application of the elements of the rise of the country and the strategic marketing theory of the leaders in the overall development of the country."
    },
