    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">1.楊中美，2013，《中國即開戰：中國新軍國主義崛起》。台北：時報文化出版。</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; text-indent:-12.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">2.Scott Burchill等著，莊皓雲譯，2010，《國際關係理論》Theories of Internation，台北：時英出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">3.朱雲漢、賈慶國等著，2010，《從國際關係理論看中國崛起》。台北：五南圖書出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">4.Robert Keohane &amp; Helen Milner合著，姜鵬、董素華譯，2005，《國際化與國內政治》</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-indent:12.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">Internationalization and Domestic Politics。北京：北京大學出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">5.Martin Jacques著，李隆生、張逸安譯，2010，《當中國統治世界》。台北：聯經出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">6.吳敬璉，2005，《當代中國經濟改革：探索中國經濟順利轉型的秘密》，台北：McGraw-Hill</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-indent:12.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">國際股份有限公司。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">7.謝慶奎、楊鳯春、燕繼榮、鍾嫣慧合著，2005，《中國大陸政府與政治》。台北：五南圖書出</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">&nbsp;&nbsp;版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">8.David Lampton著，林添貴譯，2016，《從鄧小平到習近平》。台北：遠流出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">9.林毅夫、蔡昉、李周合著，2005，《中國經濟改革與發展》。台北：聯經出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">10.Will Hutton著，林添貴譯，2009，《惡兆-中國經濟降溫之後》。台北：遠流出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">11.Robert Gilpin 謝慶奎、楊鳯春、燕繼榮、鍾嫣慧合著，2005，《全球政治經濟學-解讀國際</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">&nbsp;&nbsp;經濟秩序》Global Political Economy。上海：上海人民出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">12.周世雄著，2003，《國際關係：權力與制度》。台北：五南圖書出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">13.寇健文著，2005，《中共菁英政治的演變：制度與權力轉移1978-2004》。台北：五南圖書出</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">&nbsp;&nbsp;版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">14.David Potter, David Goldblatt, Margaret Kiloh and Paul Lewis著，王謙、李昌麟、林賢治、黃惟</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">&nbsp; 堯譯，2000，《民主化》Democratization。台北：韋伯出版社。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">15.Stephen Flanagan, Michael Marti著，方淑惠、余佳玲譯，2005，《人民解放軍與變動的中國》</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">&nbsp;&nbsp;。台北：國防部史政編譯室。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">16.Andrew Scobell, Larry Wortzel著，黃淑芬譯，2006，《中共軍文變化》。台北：國防部史政</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 編譯室。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">17.Robert Grattan著，林宜瑄譯，2007，《策略過程：軍事與商業之比較》。台北：國防部史政</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 編譯室。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">18.Roger Cliff著，余忠勇譯，2001，《中共商用科技的軍事潛力》The Military Potential of </span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">&nbsp;&nbsp; China&rsquo;s Commercial Technology。台北：國防部史政編譯室。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">19.大前研一著，趙佳誼、劉錦秀、黃碧君譯，2003，《中華聯邦》。台北：商周出版。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">20.大前研一著，張新琦譯，2003，《力用中國》CHUGOKU Shift。台北：天下雜誌。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">21.大前研一著，許曉平譯，2002，《中國，出租中》The China Impact 。台北：天下雜誌。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">22.萊斯特‧梭羅著，齊思賢譯，2000，《知識經濟時代》。台北：時報文化。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">23.吳思華著，2001，《策略九說：策略思考的本質》。台北：城邦文化。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"punctuation-trim:leading\">24.Joseph Nye,Jr.著，吳家恆、方祖芳譯，2006，《柔性權力》。台北：遠流出版。</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"text-autospace:none\">25.翟本瑞、周惠那、陳淑慧著，2016，《創意思考與實例演練(Creative Thinking and </span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"text-autospace:none\">&nbsp;&nbsp; Experience)》。台中：逢甲大學通識教育中心。</span></span></p>\n\n<div>26.顧長永著，2013，《東南亞各國政府與政治：持續與變遷》。台北：台灣商務出版。</div>\n",
    "tpb_book_en": null
  },
